---
<section class="min-h-[85vh] flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center px-6 relative z-10 select-none">
  <!-- Heading -->
  <h1 class="text-heading-40 sm:text-heading-56 md:text-heading-64 font-bold text-gray-1000 tracking-tight max-w-3xl leading-[1.05] mb-6">
    Peer support, verified by your university.
  </h1>

  <!-- Supporting paragraph -->
  <p class="text-copy-16 sm:text-copy-18 text-gray-600 max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-10">
    Discuss academic pressure, stress, and isolation with upper-class mentors. Your credentials verify student status, but your identity remains anonymous to everyone.
  </p>

  <!-- CTA Buttons -->
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full max-w-md">
    <a
      href="/register"
      class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-background-100 hover:bg-gray-800 rounded-sm text-button-14 font-semibold transition-colors text-center cursor-pointer"
    >
      Create Account
    </a>
    <a
      href="/login"
      class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-sm text-button-14 font-semibold transition-colors text-center cursor-pointer"
    >
      Sign In
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
